text.section:
No student journalist has the right to exercise freedom of speech or the press in institution-sponsored student media when such media:

Is libelous or slanderous;


Constitutes an unwarranted invasion of privacy;


Violates federal or state law; or


So incites students as to create a clear and present danger of the commission of an unlawful act, the violation of institution policy, or the material and substantial disruption of the orderly operation of the institution.
